      "message": "test(s5): run 17 C19 evidence cases in CI and document serial protocol\n\nWHY: The existing docs CI did not run the Python observation consumer, so a\nnew concurrency proof would otherwise remain source-only. Execute all 15\noriginal and 2 bounded CLI subprocess cases on each candidate; late samples\nremain explicitly rejected after a concurrent stop. Document inode locking,\nrecovery limits and unchanged candidate-bound wall-clock requirements.\n\nNo test skips, baselines, schema or admission thresholds changed.",
